OL,3,GNEWSASummer solstice murder accused
OL,4,Acharged with assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of murdering another man
OL,7,Fat a summer solstice event in the Peak
OL,8,FDistrict has been charged with two
OL,9,Fcounts of assault.
OL,11,FSzymon Babynko, a 24-year-old Polish
OL,12,Fnational, was charged with the murder
OL,13,Fof Isaac Clare-Watts in September,
OL,14,Fafter the 26-year-old's body was found
OL,15,Fin the area of the Nine Ladies Stone
OL,16,FCircle in Stanton Lees at 13:38 BST on
OL,17,F22 June.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
