OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSASummer solstice murder accused
OL,4,Acharged with assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FBabynko, formerly of Commonwealth Way
OL,7,Fin London, pleaded not guilty at
OL,8,FChesterfield Magistrates' Court on
OL,9,FTuesday to two assault charges, which
OL,10,Fare alleged to have occurred near the
OL,11,FNine Ladies Stone Circle on 23 June.
OL,13,FDerbyshire Police said the case was
OL,14,Fadjourned, and Babynko is next due to
OL,15,Fappear at Derby Crown Court on 8
OL,16,FDecember.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
